I used to just put it on like websites

01:56:57.586 --> 01:57:00.170
and I'd be like, "Who wants it for free?"

01:57:00.170 --> 01:57:02.083
- We used a service for that

01:57:02.083 --> 01:57:03.320
when we moved to get rid of our couch.

01:57:03.320 --> 01:57:04.435
- Yeah, I'm like, "Who wants it?"

01:57:04.435 --> 01:57:06.628
- We just like, there's a
website where you can just like,

01:57:06.628 --> 01:57:08.513
just put it up for like zero yen.

01:57:08.513 --> 01:57:09.713
It's like, "Come and get it."

01:57:09.713 --> 01:57:10.926
And some dude came to get it.

01:57:10.926 --> 01:57:13.260
- Yeah, as long as you take
it away, you deal with it,

01:57:13.260 --> 01:57:14.093
you can have it.

01:57:14.093 --> 01:57:15.499
That's what I did in the
UK with all the stuff.

01:57:15.499 --> 01:57:20.079
Like, I had a budget gaming
chair that was just broken.

01:57:20.079 --> 01:57:22.226
I was like, "Oh, if someone
wants it, you gonna have it.

01:57:22.226 --> 01:57:23.085
"It's kinda jank.

01:57:23.085 --> 01:57:25.039
"It still works, but it's not great."

01:57:25.039 --> 01:57:26.390
And then someone just came.

01:57:26.390 --> 01:57:28.304
Some Russian guy turned up to my door.

01:57:28.304 --> 01:57:30.455
"My son will love this chair."

01:57:30.455 --> 01:57:32.553
And I was like, all right, cool.

01:57:32.553 --> 01:57:34.879
- Yeah, I just don't want
to do anything in this heat.

01:57:34.879 --> 01:57:37.273
Like, if I'm not inside in
an air conditioned place,

01:57:37.273 --> 01:57:39.462
then I just don't want to be there.

01:57:39.462 --> 01:57:41.433
Like, me and Sydney tried
to like schedule a date

01:57:41.433 --> 01:57:43.086
the other day where we just
go out and do something

01:57:43.086 --> 01:57:44.915
and then we realized we just don't want

01:57:44.915 --> 01:57:47.261
to fucking do anything outside.

01:57:47.261 --> 01:57:49.357
Let's just try and find something inside

01:57:49.357 --> 01:57:51.723
because it's literally
impossible to do anything.

01:57:51.723 --> 01:57:54.927
And especially now with
inside activities kind of

01:57:54.927 --> 01:57:57.200
on lockdown, it's really hard
to find anything right now.

01:57:57.200 --> 01:57:58.033
- Exactly.

01:57:58.033 --> 01:57:58.866
- True, true.

01:57:58.866 --> 01:58:00.449
Amen to that.

01:58:00.449 --> 01:58:02.331
- You know who else hates the summer heat?

01:58:02.331 --> 01:58:03.539
Our patrons.

01:58:03.539 --> 01:58:04.372
- Ooh.

01:58:04.372 --> 01:58:05.205
- Probably, I don't know.

01:58:05.205 --> 01:58:06.054
(everyone laughs)

01:58:06.054 --> 01:58:07.223
Actually, if our patrons were here,

01:58:07.223 --> 01:58:08.245
they would definitely hate summer.

01:58:08.245 --> 01:58:09.078
- They would hate summer.

01:58:09.078 --> 01:58:11.180
If you're British, I don't
know if you hate summer or not.

01:58:11.180 --> 01:58:12.263
- I can't stand this.

01:58:12.263 --> 01:58:14.216
- I didn't until I moved outside.

01:58:14.216 --> 01:58:16.260
And now I hate the summer.

01:58:16.260 --> 01:58:17.848
Not as much as the winter though.

01:58:17.848 --> 01:58:18.681
Winter sucks.

01:58:18.681 --> 01:58:20.253
- Doesn't help that we
record "Trash Taste"

01:58:20.253 --> 01:58:22.223
with these blasting lights on us.

01:58:22.223 --> 01:58:23.629
- I was sweating a lot of this episode

01:58:23.629 --> 01:58:26.212
because we didn't turn
on the air conditioning

01:58:26.212 --> 01:58:27.977
in this fucking heat.

01:58:27.977 --> 01:58:29.570
- As you were talking earlier,

01:58:29.570 --> 01:58:31.213
I could literally see
a giant bead of sweat.

01:58:31.213 --> 01:58:33.941
- It's 'cause I've got the
fucking sun staring at me

01:58:33.941 --> 01:58:36.305
and we don't even fucking have the AC on.

01:58:36.305 --> 01:58:37.493
- The price that we, you know,

01:58:37.493 --> 01:58:38.805
you can't say that we
don't care about you guys.

01:58:38.805 --> 01:58:41.300
- Meilyne gave me the Evian facial spray

01:58:41.300 --> 01:58:42.916
which I actually accepted.

01:58:42.916 --> 01:58:44.692
And I realize that it did nothing.

01:58:44.692 --> 01:58:46.000
- How the tables have turned.

01:58:46.000 --> 01:58:48.208
- We suffer to make good
content for you guys.

01:58:48.208 --> 01:58:49.931
- So, if you'd like to
support our suffering,

01:58:49.931 --> 01:58:51.818
then make sure to go to our Patreon,

01:58:51.818 --> 01:58:52.960
patreon.com/trashtaste.

01:58:52.960 --> 01:58:54.044
Also follow us on Twitter,

01:58:54.044 --> 01:58:55.248
send us the memes on the subreddit,

01:58:55.248 --> 01:58:57.722
and if you hate our face,
listen to us on Spotify.

01:58:57.722 --> 01:58:59.830
- Yeah, and I guess that's this episode,

01:58:59.830 --> 01:59:03.241
this summery themed episode
of "Trash Taste," I suppose.

01:59:03.241 --> 01:59:04.633
Was it summery themed?

01:59:04.633 --> 01:59:05.670
- Well, you're dressed for the occasion.

01:59:05.670 --> 01:59:06.503
- I, you know-

01:59:06.503 --> 01:59:07.980
- You're so dressed well for the occasion.

01:59:07.980 --> 01:59:10.275
- I'm gonna start a barbecue after this.

01:59:10.275 --> 01:59:12.358
(everyone laughs)

01:59:12.358 --> 01:59:13.316
- Very dad of you.

01:59:13.316 --> 01:59:14.544
- Yeah, but anyway,

01:59:14.544 --> 01:59:16.012
that's been this episode of "Trash Taste."

01:59:16.012 --> 01:59:19.497
Hope you enjoy your summer, and
we'll see you all next time.

01:59:19.497 --> 01:59:20.745
Bye!
- Bye!

01:59:20.745 --> 01:59:23.745
